    "body": "1. Given how few cases there are at this point I also don't think we should add an extended attribute for this just yet.\r\n2. If this is done through an extended attribute there should only be one which then changes the prototype chain for both interface and interface object at the same time. For `DOMException` that would then fix #1107 too.",
